            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 984,
            "text": "{\"type\":\"file\",\"name\":\"scripted.yaml\",\"path\":\"agents/scripted.yaml\",\"size\":725,\"sha\":\"d690804837f333f85ec75be5ced580917b54c495\",\"commit_sha\":\"a8db04a2e4d18291bb7dfcfe81c33848d164e79e\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8\",\"content\":\"# The same agent on the platform's scripted model double, so a run is\\n# deterministic and costs nothing: each prompt carries a <<SCRIPT {...}>>\\n# directive naming what a real model does on the instruction (introspection-cloud\\n# docs/design/sdk-end-to-end-walk.md §2). Selected per task with agent_name.\\nname: scripted\\ndescription: Calls the hello MCP for the Harbor task, on the scripted model double\\nai:\\n  model: introspection/scripted-llm\\n  thinking_level: low\\ntools:\\n  - read\\n  - bash\\n  - write\\nmcp:\\n  mode: tools\\n  servers:\\n    hello-mcp:\\n      include:\\n        - echo\\nskills: []\\nsubagents: []\\nsystem_instructions:\\n  mode: append\\n  content: |\\n    Use the declared hello MCP whenever the task asks you to echo a message.\\n\",\"truncated\":false}"
